    <details open>
      <summary><span class="cat">How it works</span><span class="q">Will this actually change my belly, or just hide it while it is on?</span><span class="plus">+</span></summary>
      <div class="ans">You are flat and smooth under your clothes from the second you pull it on. That part you see on day one. The 3D compression holds the whole middle all day, low where the belly actually sits, and with daily wear women describe the waist coming back around week three. It holds while you wear it, and it is made to be worn daily, like a bra. It does not melt anything away and it does not remove loose skin. Nothing you can buy online does.</div>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary><span class="cat">Your body</span><span class="q">Is this only for postpartum?</span><span class="plus">+</span></summary>
      <div class="ans">No. Postpartum is where a lot of women find it, but the brief does not ask where the belly came from. The meno belly, the belly after a hysterectomy, the one still there ten years after your last baby, or a middle that changed after weight loss: same hold, same result under your clothes.</div>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary><span class="cat">C-section</span><span class="q">Will it touch my scar?</span><span class="plus">+</span></summary>
      <div class="ans">It is a true high waist, so the edge sits above the scar line, and the edges are bonded, so no seam and no elastic lands on the line, bikini or vertical. Every scar is different, which is exactly what the 90 days are for.</div>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary><span class="cat">Sizing</span><span class="q">Which size, and what if I get it wrong?</span><span class="plus">+</span></summary>
      <div class="ans">Measure your waist, not your dress size, and use the size guide in the order box. XS to 5XL. Between two sizes, size up. Wrong size? We send the right one, free.</div>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary><span class="cat">Fabric and care</span><span class="q">What is it made of? Is it hot or itchy?</span><span class="plus">+</span></summary>
      <div class="ans">83% nylon, 17% spandex with breathable mesh panels and a cotton-lined gusset. Thin and silky, no boning, no latex, no hooks, and it does not turn into an oven under a dress. Machine wash cold in a laundry bag or hand wash, air dry, no softener, and the hold stays like day one.</div>
